bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "View Chapter UI" as UI
boundary Router
control TextChapterController
control TextChapterService
entity TextChapterModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Open chapter detail
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. GET /chapter/id/{id}
activate Router

Router -> TextChapterController: 3. getChapterById(id)
activate TextChapterController

TextChapterController -> TextChapterService: 4. getChapterById(ObjectId)
activate TextChapterService

TextChapterService -> TextChapterModel: 5. Aggregate(match + lookup + project)
activate TextChapterModel
TextChapterModel -> MongoDB: 6. Aggregate pipeline
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> TextChapterModel: 7. Aggregated result
deactivate MongoDB
TextChapterModel --> TextChapterService: 8. Chapter detail
deactivate TextChapterModel

TextChapterService --> TextChapterController: 9. Chapter detail
deactivate TextChapterService
TextChapterController --> Router: 10. 200 OK
deactivate TextChapterController
Router --> UI: 11. Render chapter + text
deactivate Router
UI --> User: 12. View chapter content
deactivate UI
deactivate User
@enduml
